:"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":185,"digest":"sha256:a42d1f8be3d488cf273762e2b7641549fbbce2054cb248ac36bceeba8359c534","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-31T00:43:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T00:43:32Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/releases/download/v3.14-U114/SHA256SUMS.txt"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/releases/assets/693903057","id":693903057,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT20C984pXB7R","name":"u114-release-verification.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Cursiv-Local","id":316371590,"node_id":"U_kgDOEttyhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316371590?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local","html_url":"https://github.com/Cursiv-Local","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cursiv-Local/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":4246,"digest":"sha256:80160cab4b95022ba0d8d35fb7480f67b7f190ab0d76e1de77db078dcec43e59","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-31T00:43:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T00:43:33Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/releases/download/v3.14-U114/u114-release-verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/tarball/v3.14-U114","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/zipball/v3.14-U114","body":"# Cursiv 3.14-U114 — Source targeting and evidence reliability\r\n\r\nRequests for an exact public application file and function now inspect that target first, returning checked declarations, conditions, returns and real file/line references. The existing source allowlist, hash checks, permission boundaries and read budgets remain.\r\n\r\nSource-code line numbers are classified as locations rather than hypothetical measurements. Quoted examples, negated execution claims, mathematical self-checks and user-supplied numeric scenario inputs no longer trigger unrelated verification interruptions. False tool/source assertions and unsupported resource safety/runtime conclusions remain checked. Legitimate substantive corrections are preserved.\r\n\r\nNative source answers explicitly identify that no model inference occurred. Diagnostics separate available tools, prepared tool schemas, executed results, pending write previews and successful/denied source reads. Manual provider selection and existing privacy/offline controls remain; notebook confirmations, memory, portable workspaces and optional USB key export are preserved.\r\n\r\nThe removed Guardian scanner/service was not restored. Git history and exact causes are documented in [the audit](U113-GUARDIAN-AUDIT.md). [Manual testing instructions and limitations](U113-MANUAL-TEST-HANDOFF.md) distinguish software regressions from real model behavior. No live AI-provider request or model inference was used for this follow-up. Real provider quality, latency and independent self-correction still need owner testing.\r\n\r\nExact-main source checks passed: **2,930 Windows / 2,913 Mac / 2,912 Linux**, plus19 passing subtests on each platform. Native Windows frozen/USB-layout and Mac frozen self-tests passed. All8 platform assets have verified signatures under the existing pinned owner identity. The hosted Windows build uses the existing tag-only builder and mandatory main/lock/frozen/portable gates.\r\n\r\nThe initial release security gate identified seven advisories in the existing PDF dependency. U114 raises its floor and hash lock to [pypdf6.21.4](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.21.4), with archive hashes verified against [PyPI metadata](https://pypi.org/pypi/pypdf/6.21.4/json). Hosted security and source checks passed with the updated lock and PDF workflows; no local dependency install was performed.\r\n\r\n[Release/source verification](https://github.com/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/releases/download/v3.14-U114/u114-release-verification.json) and [manual testing checklist](https://github.com/Cursiv-Local/Cursiv/blob/main/docs/U113-MANUAL-TEST-HANDOFF.md). Publication records are added separately after readback. Owner signatures are distinct from Windows CA signing and Mac notarization.\r\n"}
